"text": "According to the SFJAZZ ticket policies page:\n\n- **Flat fee for returning tickets**: $25 flat fee for ticket returns purchased for SFJAZZ concerts, which allows a patron to receive 'Box Office Credit' for purchasing tickets to a future concert.\n\n- **Advance-notice deadline**: Ticket returns are accepted up to 48 hours prior to the performance.\n\n- **Membership level that waives the fee**: This fee is waived for all members at the Contributor level ($250/year) and above.\n\n**Official source link**: https://www.sfjazz.org/tickets/ticket-policies/"
}

